@startuml
title sd — UC6 Verify CANable transmission (RX1–RX6)
actor Operator
participant "USB application" as App
participant BenchReceiver as Receiver
participant TwaiPort as Port
participant CANable
Operator -> App : start on isolated bench
App -> Receiver : start()
Receiver -> Port : start(125 kbit/s normal mode)
Port --> Receiver : initialized / error
App --> Operator : receiver=ready / receiver=fault
Operator -> CANable : send one known frame after ready
CANable -> Port : CAN frame
note over Port : Normal-mode controller supplies ACK automatically.
loop Each application iteration
  App -> Receiver : service()
  Receiver -> Port : poll faults, receive at most one frame
  alt valid frame
    Port --> Receiver : received frame
    Receiver -> Receiver : retain count and last frame
    App --> Operator : best-effort frame output
  else empty queue
    Port --> Receiver : empty (not a fault)
  else SDK error or malformed frame
    Receiver -> Port : stop()
  end
end
Operator -> App : status / stop
App -> Receiver : inspect retained results / stop()
App --> Operator : retained count, last frame, diagnostics
@enduml
